=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/OWkfqTMJxnptmA4oxuNzHfBpcE.png?width=68&height=68\" alt=\"\"></p></div><div data-framer-name=\"transform-text-wrap\"><p data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"></p><h2 data-styles-preset=\"lQWrp5ZYa\" dir=\"auto\">See How Norton Neo Transforms The Web</h2><p></p><p data-styles-preset=\"ivMt0QIQh\" dir=\"auto\">Your life online is never still. You are streaming, shopping, working, connecting. Norton Neo adapts in stride, pulling the best forward while staying simple at the surface.</p></div><div><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"164\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/zQBAj2UCdzdFuc8Q6f7tWbOp4eA.png?width=164&height=103\" alt=\"decorative image showing broswer history\"></p></div><div data-framer-name=\"image-1\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"173\" height=\"109\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/bxxhfV4GTTiLRYDEkqt71qo79E.png?width=173&height=109\" alt=\"\"></p></div><div data-framer-name=\"Hand-1\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"832\" height=\"402\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 832px, (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 732px, (max-width: 809.98px) 353px\" srcset=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9z3R35Tbu5ZT0wfa7RQaEG4Rdlo.png?scale-down-to=512&width=832&height=402 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9z3R35Tbu5ZT0wfa7RQaEG4Rdlo.png?width=832&height=402 832w\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9z3R35Tbu5ZT0wfa7RQaEG4Rdlo.png?width=832&height=402\" alt=\"\"></p></div></div><div data-framer-name=\"Privacy section\" id=\"trust\"><div><p><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2880\" height=\"1720\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 100vw, (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) max(100vw, calc(100vw + 690px))\" srcset=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/vbtli7tUSNQpxYZ7JqRPoQviME.png?scale-down-to=512&width=2880&height=1720 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/vbtli7tUSNQpxYZ7JqRPoQviME.png?scale-down-to=1024&width=2880&height=1720 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/vbtli7tUSNQpxYZ7JqRPoQviME.png?scale-down-to=2048&width=2880&height=1720 2048w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/vbtli7tUSNQpxYZ7JqRPoQviME.png?width=2880&height=1720 2880w\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/vbtli7tUSNQpxYZ7JqRPoQviME.png?width=2880&height=1720\" alt=\"\"></p><div data-framer-name=\"headline\"><p data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"></p><h2 data-styles-preset=\"lQWrp5ZYa\" dir=\"auto\">Privacy is not a setting. It is the foundation.</h2><p></p><p data-styles-preset=\"ivMt0QIQh\" dir=\"auto\">Most AI products ask you to trade privacy for capability. Norton Neo was built so you never have to choose.</p></div></div><div data-framer-name=\"section\"><div><p dir=\"auto\">AI Privacy by Design</p></div><p dir=\"auto\">Zero retention policy with all AI providers. Neo does not train on your data. AI requests are routed server-side so providers never receive your IP address or browser headers. Sources shown on every AI summary. 您的数据归您所有。</p></div><div data-framer-name=\"section\"><div><p dir=\"auto\">Integrated Ad Blocker</p></div><p dir=\"auto\">Cleaner browsing, smarter blocking, and no extensions required. The ad blocker runs quietly in the background every session, active by default from the moment you open the browser.</p></div><div data-framer-name=\"section\"><div><p dir=\"auto\">Anti-Fingerprinting Protection</p></div><p dir=\"auto\">Most tracking does not rely on cookies anymore. Websites build a hidden profile using dozens of invisible signals: your screen size, installed fonts, GPU behavior, audio settings, and more. Neo blocks and randomizes those signals by default, globally, across every site you visit. 无需设置。 No toggle. 始终开启。</p></div><div data-framer-name=\"section\"><div><p dir=\"auto\">Built-in VPN</p></div><p dir=\"auto\">Powered by Norton and built directly into the browser. One click encrypts all your browsing traffic. No separate app, no extra subscription required. A strict no-log policy means your browsing history, DNS queries, and IP address are never stored. Independently audited annually.</p></div><div data-framer-name=\"section\"><div><p dir=\"auto\">设计安全</p></div><p dir=\"auto\">Privacy is not a layer added on top of Neo. It is part of the browser architecture itself. Built and maintained by Gen Digital, the team behind Norton, one of the most trusted names in consumer digital security.</p></div></div><div data-framer-name=\"Testimonial Section\" id=\"testimonials\"><div data-framer-name=\"main-testimonial-text\"><div data-framer-name=\"testimonial-top-img-wrap\"><div data-framer-name=\"Rectangle 325643\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/8AQsGNzIxzxIoEksI8cUtRth0.png?width=70&height=70\" alt=\"\"></p></div><div data-framer-name=\"Testimonial-support-img2\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/PlPoD1Vm2EUVFjsn0zuLjE7VU.png?width=70&height=70\" alt=\"\"></p></div><div data-framer-name=\"Testimonial-support-img1\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/eUisEl30c6GfXqbRsC6SA0q0.png?width=70&height=70\" alt=\"\"></p></div><div data-framer-name=\"Testimonial-support-img3\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/4nV4R3EQ1b5SBj7hcgMPGnCAg.png?width=70&height=70\" alt=\"\"></p></div><div data-framer-name=\"Testimonial-support-img5\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/A7Nkd5KnXIDsPRMpXyab5Hqpw.png?width=70&height=70\" alt=\"\"></p></div></div><div><p data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\"></p><h2 data-styles-preset=\"lQWrp5ZYa\" dir=\"auto\">How people areusing Norton Neo</h2><p></p><